assertion  XBD.pthread.h.004
anchor     basedefs/pthread.h.html#DESCRIPTION/PTHREAD_MUTEX_NORMAL
class      required
since      2001
says       PTHREAD_MUTEX_NORMAL, PTHREAD_MUTEX_ERRORCHECK and
           PTHREAD_MUTEX_RECURSIVE have three different values.
note       PTHREAD_MUTEX_DEFAULT may map to any of them and is left out
           (pthread_mutexattr_settype page) (Q-165).
test       t/004-mutex-types.c
nomutant   header content check; needs the Tier 0 header mutants

